#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_bank_ocr/models/pb_bank_self_service.py:0
msgid "A change to your bank account is already waiting for approval. Take it back first if you want to send a different one."
msgstr "Perubahan rekening bank Anda sudah menunggu persetujuan. Tarik kembali dulu jika ingin mengirim yang lain."

